.TH OCTA-PANEL 1 "" "OCTA-CAPTURE @PROJECT_VERSION@" "OCTA-CAPTURE Manual"
.SH NAME
octa\-panel \- select the device display or identify a unit
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBocta-panel display\fR BUS [CTRL-PORT]
\fBocta-panel identify\fR [CTRL-PORT]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Send the LCD mixer-selection command (BUS 0..3 for A..D), or the identification blink command.
Print fresh device state as JSON. These are device commands; a successful send
alone does not visually confirm the physical display or lamp.
.PP
The default CTRL MIDI port is hw:CARD=OCTACAPTURE,DEV=0,SUBDEV=1. Close other control-panel/CTRL clients before opening it. Audio streaming is independent of this connection.

.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero indicates success; nonzero indicates a usage, device or operation error.
.SH SEE ALSO
octa-capture(1), octa-status(1), octa-preset(1)
